A next-generation AI-powered trading intelligence system that combines Twitter/X sentiment analysis, financial news sentiment, and 
technical candlestick pattern recognition using a Transformer + LSTM hybrid deep learning architecture.

The model predicts potential market movement by understanding both:

📢 What people are saying (market sentiment)
📈 What charts are showing (technical analysis)
📌 Features

✅ Real-time Twitter/X sentiment analysis
✅ Financial news sentiment extraction
✅ Candlestick pattern recognition
✅ Technical indicators integration
✅ Transformer + LSTM hybrid architecture
✅ Buy / Sell / Hold signal generation
✅ Multi-source data fusion
✅ Deep learning based forecasting
✅ Interactive visualization dashboard
✅ Backtesting support

